// T31 (RFC §7.4 & §14):
// 1. Unbounded liveness `Always (filed => Eventually decided)` WITHOUT `Assumes` returns INCONCLUSIVE (exit 3).
// 2. Bounded response `Always (filed => EventuallyWithin 3 decided)` violates when clock advances to 3 without decision!
//! explore-domain: duration = 3
Fact matter Identified by M1.
Fact filed Identified by matter.
Fact decided Identified by matter.

Act rule-on-matter Actor actor Related to matter
  Holds when filed(matter)
  Creates decided(matter).

Property unbounded-liveness-missing-fairness
  When Always (filed(M1) => Eventually decided(M1)).

+actor("Panel").
+filed(M1).
